#EXTM3U
# MotionTV demo playlist: openly licensed films and public test streams, for trying MotionTV and for
# Google Play's review (play/README.md). It is what "Use sample test playlist" fills in, in the
# Google Play edition. Big Buck Bunny and Tears of Steel are (c) Blender Foundation, CC BY 3.0
# (peach.blender.org, mango.blender.org). The live streams are test signals that Unified Streaming
# and the DASH Industry Forum publish for testing players.
